WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Today is a war-free day

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Otherwise, I will turn you into a meat pie in an instant

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Boss, look at me

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
If my boss takes action, I can chop you into 3,756 pieces in an instant.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,540
If you have a little courage

6
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,540
Escape tomorrow morning

7
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,540
I'll deal with you personally, Deng Dalang.

8
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,540
See you tomorrow

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,540
Anyone who does not go will be reborn in the flesh.

10
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,540
together with you

11
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:29,540
Tomorrow I will make you two Tang Langs become meat paste.

12
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:32,630
Boss, how did I perform?

13
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:35,630
After the trial is completed tomorrow, I will give you the authentic leg meat to eat.

14
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:40,630
The boss already has three at the eighth level. Is that enough? Three is not enough.

15
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:41,630
The more the better

16
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:43,630
Guaranteed completion of tasks

17
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:47,580
That dove in the sky is you

18
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:49,580
Wait for me in Futidong tomorrow

19
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,670
Not convinced

20
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:52,670
Escape from Titong tomorrow

21
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:54,670
Watch me eat your big chicken drumstick
